<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφραγνύ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφράγνυμι, διαφάρξαντι τὰ
					μετακιόνια</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.373.251
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μεταστύλιον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.1054.63
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				20.235d
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be divided off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὑμέσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήνιγξι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erasistr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.603
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				3.1.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφρᾰγείς</span>”
				<i>obstructed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
					<u>Anat.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλλοβα διαπεφραγμένα</span>”
				<i>with divisions,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					8.5.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
